<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

	<PropertyGroup>
		<TargetFrameworks>netstandard2.0</TargetFrameworks>
		<LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
		<ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
		<Nullable>enable</Nullable>
		<IsPackable>true</IsPackable>

		<!-- NuGet package metadata -->
		<PackageId>NTokenizers</PackageId>
		<Version>9.0.0</Version>
		<Authors>crwsolutions</Authors>
		<Copyright>(c) crwsolutions</Copyright>
		<PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
		<Description>Collection of .NET streaming lexer and tokenizers for Markdown, HTML, JSON, XML, C#, TypeScript, Python, SQL, CSS, YAML, TOML, C, C++, Java, Go, Rust, Kotlin and Swift processing, plus a stream-capable Markdown to HTML converter (ToHtml API). See README for usage and details.</Description>
		<PackageDescription>Collection of .NET streaming lexer and tokenizers for Markdown, HTML, JSON, XML, C#, TypeScript, Python, SQL, CSS, YAML, TOML, C, C++, Java, Go, Rust, Kotlin and Swift processing, plus a stream-capable Markdown to HTML converter (ToHtml API). See README for usage and details.</PackageDescription>
		<PackageTags>markdown;md;html;json;xml;c#;csharp;typescript;javascript;python;sql;css;yaml;toml;c;c++;cpp;java;go;rust;kotlin;swift;stream;streaming;parse;parsing;lexer;tokenizers;dotnet;tohtml</PackageTags>
		<RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/crwsolutions/ntokenizers</RepositoryUrl>
		<RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
		<PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
		<PackageProjectUrl>https://crwsolutions.github.io/ntokenizers</PackageProjectUrl>
		<Title>NTokenizers</Title>
		<PackageReleaseNotes>BREAKING: token emission is now async end-to-end.
- All ParseAsync/Parse handler overloads take Func&lt;TToken, Task&gt; instead of Action&lt;TToken&gt;; the parse loop awaits the handler for every token.
- Renamed: RegisterInlineTokenHandler is now InlineMetadata&lt;TToken&gt;.ParseInlinesAsync(handler) - call and await it from inside the container token's handler; it completes when the section is fully consumed (the onInlinesCompleted callback is gone).
- ToHtml: MarkdownConverter writes asynchronously straight to the caller's TextWriter. ToHtml(string)/ToHtmlDocument(string) are kept as in-memory convenience wrappers (sync-over-async).
See the v8 to v9 migration guide: https://crwsolutions.github.io/ntokenizers/migrating-v8-v9</PackageReleaseNotes>
		<GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
		<PackageIcon>icon.png</PackageIcon>
	</PropertyGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
		<None Include="..\..\art\icon.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
	</ItemGroup>

</Project>
